 class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">Xem bảng phí</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n </tr>\\n <tr>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">51 - 100Kg</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">2,500 đ/kg</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">Xem bảng phí</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n </tr>\\n <tr>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">101 - 200Kg</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">2,400 đ/kg</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">Xem bảng phí</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n </tr>\\n <tr>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px; background-color: rgb(201, 218, 248);\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">201 - 500Kg</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px; background-color: rgb(201, 218, 248);\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">2,300 đ/kg</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px; background-color: rgb(201, 218, 248);\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">Xem bảng phí</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n </tr>\\n <tr>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">501 - 750Kg</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">2,200 đ/kg</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">Xem bảng phí</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n </tr>\\n <tr>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">751 - 1.000Kg</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">2,100 đ/kg</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">Xem bảng phí</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n </tr>\\n <tr>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">1.001 - 2.000Kg</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">2,000 đ/kg</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px;\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">Xem bảng phí</span></p>\\n  </td>\\n </tr>\\n <tr>\\n  <td style=\\\"padding: 1px; background-color: rgb(201, 218, 248);\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0in; font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; text-align: center; l