r-box; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; width: 707.306px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; font-weight: bold !important;\\\">Nội dung làm việc cho một dự án vận chuyển hàng đi Phú Quốc<div style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.01);width:0;height:0\\\">&nbsp;<br></div></td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A2\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">1.1</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-align-left wpdt-tc-F44336 wpdt-bold wpdt-merged-cell \\\" colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"4\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"B2\\\" data-col-index=\\\"1\\\" data-row-index=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(244, 67, 54) !important; font-weight: bold !important;\\\">Tiếp nhận thông tin yêu cầu vận chuyển hàng hóa từ khách hàng</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C2\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">Nhận thông tin yêu cầu của Quý khách hàng về việc vận chuyển hàng hóa cho các dự án công trình.</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center wpdt-bc-FCE8FF\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A3\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">1.2</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-bc-FCE8FF wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C3\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">Con Rùa Biển sẽ cử Chuyên viên phụ trách đến tận nơi kiểm tra thông tin về hàng hóa cần vận chuyển cũng như là nhu cầu thực tế chở hàng.</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A4\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"3\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">1.3</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C4\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"3\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">Xác định trọng lượng, kích thước, địa chỉ giao nhận, thời gian yêu cầu vận chuyển</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center wpdt-bc-FCE8FF\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A5\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"4\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">1.4</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-bc-FCE8FF wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C5\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"4\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">Sau khi gặp trực tiếp và trao đổi, Con Rùa Biển sẽ tư vấn cho Quý khách hàng cách thức vận chuyển hàng hóa với chi phí thấp nhất và đảm bảo an toàn nhất.</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A6\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"5\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">2.1</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-align-left wpdt-tc-F44336 wpdt-bold wpdt-merged-cell \\\" colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"3\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"B6\\\" data-col-index=\\\"1\\\" data-row-index=\\\"5\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(244, 67, 54) !important; font-weight: bold !important;\\\">Tư vấn đóng gói hàng hóa đảm bảo an toàn trong vận chuyển</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C6\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"5\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">Mặt hàng là thiết bị điện tử: Con Rùa Biển sẽ tư vấn đóng kiện gỗ [bên trong kiện gỗ cần có nhiều lớp dự phòng chống ước, va đạp và niệm giảm chấn cho đế kiện gỗ]</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center wpdt-bc-FCE8FF\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A7\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"6\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">2.2</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-bc-FCE8FF wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C7\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"6\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">Mặt hàng nặng là thiết bị máy móc: Con Rùa Biển sẽ tư vấn loại xe phù hợp nhất và chi phí thấp nhất mà vẫn đảm bảo an toàn cho hàng hóa nhất, không nhất thiết phải 100% các mặt hàng nặng phải đóng kiện gỗ trong quá trình vận chuyển đường dài.</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A8\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"7\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">2.3</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C8\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"7\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">Mỗi loại hàng hóa sẽ có tính chất bảo đảm hàng hóa một cách đặt thù và riêng biệt, không phải tất cả các loại hàng hóa điều có chung một cách đóng gói. Con Rùa Biển đảm bảo sẽ tư vấn đóng gói hợp lý nhất [chi phí thấp mà vẫn đảm bảo an toàn hàng hóa]</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center wpdt-bc-FCE8FF\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A9\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"8\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">3.1</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-align-left wpdt-tc-F44336 wpdt-bold wpdt-merged-cell \\\" colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"7\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"B9\\\" data-col-index=\\\"1\\\" data-row-index=\\\"8\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(244, 67, 54) !important; font-weight: bold !important;\\\">Xác định thông tin cần và đủ để ra quyết định về giá</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-bc-FCE8FF wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C9\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"8\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">Trọng lượng / kiện: [cân kg từng kiện hàng hoặc từng thùng hàng để có số kg]</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A10\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"9\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">3.2</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C10\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"9\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">Kích thước / kiện: [đo kích thước dài rộng cao theo đơn vị tính là mét, của từng kiện hàng hóa]</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center wpdt-bc-FCE8FF\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A11\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"10\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line