round-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">Xuất hóa đơn vận chuyển hàng hóa</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center wpdt-bc-FCE8FF\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A31\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"30\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">7.3</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-bc-FCE8FF wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C31\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"30\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">Thu tiền đơn hàng đã vận chuyển hoàn thành.</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A32\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"31\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">7.4</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C32\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"31\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important;\\\">Kết thúc một đơn hàng</td></tr></tbody></table>\"');
